    {
      "id": "2b9ad3e6-8734-4e84-89e8-c7e2caa1899b",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e pense no que a palavra mostra sobre duas pessoas.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "223ab137-de7e-44e0-9d9d-52c8170979e1",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>la pareja</strong> fala da relação atual entre duas pessoas.</p><p>Ela ajuda quando você quer dizer quem está junto com quem, sem entrar em muitos detalhes.</p><p>Essa palavra aparece em conversas sobre amigos, colegas, familia ou vida social.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/288e4f8895514688be359ab26cca5fe8_l02b01-la-pareja.mp3?Expires=1794099515&Signature=18Gsa0Qbz1lW6643mT-nnUMy3vbRxti6dNNMu9nPW6Wfk-RB-4sWIcrJ6tqlz-S-cGGOcDNL5-R5qkWmVoKXa08JWzzKzQ36czD~bQ-LnYnjjx-FgCODQJu~OVfkeWX1I9JBJrfc4nIZJXZIgMO4~3jTHKCM2GmRteUjS2hN5riDi8MTRj9DQzFhcjnNdcYMAKyzDNEIVPvISDPV4tSoY-WkOf6AhqKlaoRLqTa2uKy1l6iXCSGzAvZgCNhuOFtzDeO8fI3Nb5qXls9sg0WZPpvKeg1m5CWReRwaMfaJfAGlfU6DTquoBCrau9HmGgH0vu69Be0pXTBL1iO5~~mtSg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d3ef4315-65b0-4eb0-b6b3-dcc5da72a7c8",
      "title": "Escute a frase e observe a mudança de relação que ela comunica.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "cd613e4b-cf32-4d7a-ae5a-8b9e57703c07",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Ana y Luis se casaron el mes pasado.</strong></p><p>Em português: Ana e Luis se casaram no mês passado.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6f55e347d26849aea5c1ad4c8d763f00_l02b03-ana-y-luis-se-casaron-el-mes-pasado.mp3?Expires=1794099515&Signature=dgoap82qmWGP8nddxWpC016FUmWr~HzzSIgvYX55992QwqOJkg~eZqt1XmDMIqOO7Ofj6j26CoFZzjH3j9uyvay9u~mQvHpy2kUuGxMszYW7MSkU96b7g2ukbJCneU3ZzTL9n~waLDGgC78Tjek~VaxKhvzL4cci2-beDZFx3l7q-Pp6BGtvTlES35U0N0Yzk8mUaqUuu5NWunOfN7-lBBU3likYRcpI1kBSCi6ajS3vreN-qji4oItckd9Xst-D-HXwIlzSwnKDCHykhvODHmWYQgsmdvBuT9huLRO8HVeBl5uE9k4wJ15FL848Q1zeypmb9WDEjk6KP8yAwnG5sA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
